<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 179 0 R
/E (Merging brings multiple ideas together into a single, unified fragment. It enables you to combine elements from different sessions or concepts such as rhythms and melodies into something new while preserving the originals. In the Evolution Map, merged nodes link back to all parent fragments, maintaining full history and attribution. )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [5]
>>
